Stefan Håkans, Chairman of FC Inter's Board, regrets what happened.
Changing a coach is never an easy or pleasant task.
Shefki Kuq, however, no longer had the confidence of the club's management, so there was now no other option," Håkans said in a statement.
Piccareta's contract is valid until the end of the season.
Together with the rest of the coaching group, he is already responsible for tomorrow's home game against HIFK.
